source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A `??` a backslash precedes opens no citation, so Jira breaks the line and shows the question marks; jiro reads a hard break and keeps the citation characters as text.
-- input.jira --
a\\??x??
-- rendered.html --
<p>a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />??x??</p>
-- want.md --
a\
??x??
-- warnings.json --
[]
